## Model card

- **Name:** DeepSeek V4.1 Flash
- **Short description:** DeepSeek's deprecated MIT-licensed open-weights MoE reasoning model (552B total / 16B active parameters) with a 1M-token context window; superseded by DeepSeek V4.1 Flash 1017.
- **Provider / access:** DeepSeek API, Hugging Face (`deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash`), and 17 providers tracked on Artificial Analysis.
- **Release / knowledge:** 2026-09-10 release; deprecated on Artificial Analysis in favor of DeepSeek V4.1 Flash 1017.
- **IDs:** `deepseek/deepseek-v4-1-flash` (no Free ID on OpenCode Zen)
- **Context window:** 1M tokens input, verified via Artificial Analysis.
- **Modalities:** Text and image input; text output; reasoning enabled (Max).
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-14):** $0.30 / 1M input tokens, $1.20 / 1M output tokens (98% cache discount; $0.18/1M blended 7:2:1).
- **Architecture:** Mixture of Experts (MoE), 552B total / 16B active parameters; open weights under MIT License.

